\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. WILL your anchor hold 
\par in the storms of life,
\par When the clouds unfold 
\par their wings of strife?
\par When the strong tides lift, 
\par and the cables strain,
\par Will your anchor drift, 
\par or firm remain?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We have an anchor that keeps the soul
\par Steadfast and sure while the billows roll;
\par Fastened to the Rock which cannot move,
\par Grounded firm and deep in the Saviour's love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Will your anchor hold 
\par in the straits of fear?
\par When the breakers roar 
\par and the reef is near;
\par While the surges rave, 
\par and the wild winds blow,
\par Shall the angry waves 
\par then your bark o'erflow?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We have an anchor that keeps the soul
\par Steadfast and sure while the billows roll;
\par Fastened to the Rock which cannot move,
\par Grounded firm and deep in the Saviour's love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Will your anchor hold 
\par in the floods of death,
\par When the waters cold 
\par chill your latest breath?
\par On the rising tide 
\par you can never fail,
\par While your anchor 
\par holds within the veil.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We have an anchor that keeps the soul
\par Steadfast and sure while the billows roll;
\par Fastened to the Rock which cannot move,
\par Grounded firm and deep in the Saviour's love!
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Will your eyes behold 
\par through the morning light
\par The city of gold 
\par and the harbour bright?
\par Will you anchor safe 
\par by the heavenly shore,
\par When life's storms 
\par are past for evermore?
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par We have an anchor that keeps the soul
\par Steadfast and sure while the billows roll;
\par Fastened to the Rock which cannot move,
\par Grounded firm and deep in the Saviour's love!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

